            <note corresp="#d43-f2" n="2" xml:id="d43-f2-content">
                <p> Brown met with President Carter in the Oval Office from 4:05 until 5:05 p.m. on
                    June 2. Mondale, Brzezinski, and Jack Watson, Secretary to the Cabinet, also
                    attended the meeting. (Carter Library, Presidential Materials, President’s Daily
                    Diary) No minutes of this meeting were found..</p>
            </note>
